# CaseTrak Mobile — Non-Negotiables

## Stack
Flutter 3.x + Dart 3, Material 3, Riverpod, go_router, dio, freezed,
shared_preferences, hive, flutter_secure_storage, fl_chart.

## Architecture
Feature-first. Every feature has data/ (models, mock repo, remote repo),
domain/ (interfaces), presentation/ (screens, widgets, providers).
Every repository interface MUST have MockXRepo and RemoteXRepo.
USE_MOCK=true|false via --dart-define selects the implementation.

## Hard constraints
- Never invent DTO field names. The contract lives in @10-dto-contract.mdc.
- Never hardcode dropdown options. All options come from LookupManager.
- Never sum money across currencies without forex_rate conversion.
- Never re-filter matters client-side for MatterAccess; the API already does it.
- Backend is out of scope. Flutter client only.

